3) Role-based access control:
```python
class AccessControlService:
    def __init__(self):
        self._permissions = {}

    def set_permission(self, username, role, permission):
        if username not in self._permissions:
            self._permissions[username] = {}
        self._permissions[username][role] = permission

    def check_permission(self, username, role, action):
        if username in self._permissions and role in self._permissions[username]:
            return action in self._permissions[username][role]
        else:
            return False
``` 
